    </forcedPassions>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>miracle fertiliser</label>
        <description>{PAWN_nameDef} swears by a soil additive from an urbworld called San Diego, which the advertisement insists lets a plant draw nitrogen, phosphorus and potassium from the far side of the planet. The crops do come up bigger. They also, occasionally, taste of metal — and for reasons nobody has explained, every seam {PAWN_pronoun} works comes out poorer than it went in.</description>
