      <li>
        <label>lifelong member</label>
        <description>The animal welfare league made {PAWN_nameDef} a member for life, and after that many years of it every animal {PAWN_pronoun} meets seems to know already. {PAWN_pronoun} still sends the league a share of everything {PAWN_pronoun} earns, cheerfully, and would sooner give the caravan's silver away than haggle over the price of a goat.</description>
        <marketValueFactorOffset>0.1</marketValueFactorOffset>
        <statOffsets>
          <TrainAnimalChance>0.5</TrainAnimalChance>
