        <description>{PAWN_nameDef} was, on one urbworld, genuinely beloved: {PAWN_pronoun} played the monkey king in a retelling of an old pilgrimage epic and every household knew {PAWN_possessive} face. {PAWN_pronoun} has mentioned this in every conversation since, along with {PAWN_possessive} own high moral standards. {PAWN_possessive} signature move, a slow tactical lean away from the camera, turns out to work in a brawl.</description>
