    </forcedPassions>
    <degreeDatas>
      <li>
        <label>first of the four scalpels</label>
        <description>On {PAWN_possessive} own world {PAWN_nameDef} was first among the four great surgeons, and the rumour was that nobody died under {PAWN_possessive} hand. {PAWN_pronoun} works fast, thinks faster, and moves through a ward at a pace that alarms people. What {PAWN_pronoun} does not do any more is take {PAWN_possessive} time in theatre, or trust a patient's family, or forget what one of them did to {PAWN_objective} with a knife.</description>
